e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c4wIEzZKQZgQ7kNvwEsiN9a&_nc_oc=AdqLF1UIc8tzmsv-MEbluJlhXiEXHSWcuKT8GbjJjn9TS6UFuwHt6HSmpomsHIZBu5w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2WXaxOv-ab_zxQreyd2GFAtZ0ibrTTj0scAmpCkb5RfQ&oe=69EF7BF9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fxwwEQTp2VwQ7kNvwFKw_pY&_nc_oc=AdpRvlfX5SE-FteZ2UNcX2hFAfAEBdMRzjIRca8g0gypiC4Csm9AxoXDCNJctBVncQg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3YgTJ6xvwJ1NpRwBpAf3d7TXdUdJ-m5AsJ8UoVHdFAmQ&oe=69EF5353"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tjE37P9HskAQ7kNvwHzLaEp&_nc_oc=Adrvxz-FHrOZ4w1GSzIJMtJxbiG7WbfTBb4nIkQuA2PgAOETCS9SOqhAYmpiqxIMa74&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0V2D4glRXI9As5ZPGJi5RPoTBo5ToafFMHLSlrPcdVJw&oe=69EF5EFB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-_z0GWiQkfUQ7kNvwEdmNY-&_nc_oc=AdplyKr7Ema1i2a5p8c5vUSUze4CGeV1maJoVQhQAgUEikIRPp19tUu3fO0oRGCfiWo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0mBE083MeMZlb-Ej_NpS8vuS5JEruYO9xn1DUubJu8cw&oe=69EF604A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qGa2zqITMzEQ7kNvwFGNWYI&_nc_oc=AdraC2JirW88UByvsXKIogL0P60FiWMIxUPtjgtIivgYbtz8-mhjJHPwjSXzLoNl8FE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2YHAKq6f4SrXnWTwFLphDpIuZb2-Ci75bgjNpub66jlw&oe=69EF81BE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se